WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:26.000
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:37.370
Are you sure? 
Lee-Leng might be married when you come back.

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:41.480
There was something that Dad said.

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:45.430
There are times in life where I have to make a choice.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.590
There's going to be a difficult turning point in life like that.

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:52.730
I finally feel like that's here, right now.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.720
If I break here now, I will regret it forever!

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:02.220
Honestly, I want to go myself!
 But there are heavy chains that are binding me.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:06.200
This body is not only mine anymore!

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:10.760
These eyes are yours! I will go see your country with these eyes!

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:15.120
Even if you're by yourself, whatever storms you may face...

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:17.450
...you will be able to overcome them.

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:21.110
That's the aura you have.

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:24.840
The heavier the chains get...

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:28.120
...the more attracted I am to you.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:33.310
Beyond the Differences

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.740
You haven't found Kajika yet?!

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.440
Please be patient.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:45.160
Calm down, Lee-Leng.

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:49.870
Your Majesty, why did you let Kajika go?

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.930
You know what the situation is like in Raginei.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:56.720
Lee-Leng, what are you hiding from us?

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:02.520
Why do you try to keep Kajika from going to Raginei to that extent?

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:07.710
You would usually support her will more.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:14.150
Oh, alright. 
I got it.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:18.350
She's on RAL 102 that just departed.

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:22.010
It's headed to Vietnam first. 
 It's possible to get there before her.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:24.790
Alright, we're going to get her.
 Get things ready.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:29.090
- I'm going too! 
- You stay here. - But...

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.220
If anything happens, contact Harry.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:35.170
Yes, sir.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:41.030
I've never seen him like that before.

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:46.510
I feel like I'm responsible. 
 I didn't know that Kajika-san was hiding in my car.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.680
- It's all my fault. 
- Master Ling-Lee.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:55.880
I think she did this; all for me.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:03.010
She's supporting us in falling in love!

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:06.480
She thought that she'd get in the way if she was here.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.940
She's so wonderful!

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:17.060
- I will go along with you, sir.
- I'm going by myself. - But...

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:21.580
Yes, sir.
 There's one thing...

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:26.770
...please don't forget you're the leader of the Huangs.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.500
- Master Lee-Leng! 
 - I know!

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:43.240
Kajika.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:55.610
This plane will be landing at Raginei Samarta Airport shortly.

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:58.240
Please fasten your seatbelt.

00:04:59.140 --> 00:05:01.110
Raginei is clear and sunny...

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:04.230
I'm going to be landing soon. This is the final plane...

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:08.660
...the airport is going to close.
 I'll have time until the morning.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:20.480
Lee-Leng must be furious.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.900
He might already be here.

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:31.880
I don't want to feel like this about Lee-Leng.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:37.330
Huh? That guy looks like Carl.

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:41.920
I guess there's a lot of looka--- Carl!

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:48.000
- Carl!
- Kajika?! Are you by yourself?

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:53.510
Carl, what are you doing here in Raginei?

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:57.300
- I'm here on business.
- In regards to Eugene?

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:02.460
He's either at the Palace or the Chadlis'.

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:05.710
I'm planning to go ask Najayra myself.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:10.080
- Take me with you!
- I'm sorry, but I can't do that.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:15.780
If Najayra is the perpetrator, she's doing this to pester you.

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:19.380
If you go, it'll have an adverse effect.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:24.950
In addition, it's also a threat to the Burnsworths to back off from supporting His Majesty Rumaty.

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:31.510
- A threat. 
- Fortunately, the Rosenthals are connected through His Majesty Izmal.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.510
They have a say with the Chadlis.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:38.270
So, just leave this up to me. 
 I'll promise a good outcome.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:43.940
- I got it.
- I'll escort you to the hotel.

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:49.510
- Where are you staying at? 
- Um, I haven't decided yet.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.190
Did you leave without telling anyone?

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.020
It's because Lee-Leng wouldn't let me go.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.840
He thought it was his duty.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:01.140
He would never let you come to Raginei 
by yourself during these times.

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:04.710
I think Lee-Leng is going to come after me.

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:07.350
You're not going to tell me to go home, are you?

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:11.080
I'm not going home!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:13.750
Alright.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:17.960
If you find out what's going on, would you go home?

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:22.700
Then, I'll convince Lee-Leng.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.890
Anyway, come stay at my hotel for the night.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:31.690
- Thanks! You can go ahead. I'm going to get my bags.
- The car will be waiting for you outside.

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:42.450
- Carl! 
- Lee-Leng.

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:47.330
I saw Kajika there; she told me you'd be arriving.

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:55.420
The final flight just arrived. 
Why don't you stay at my hotel for the night.

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:59.020
I appreciate it, but...

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:01.850
Lee-Leng, wait a minute!

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:06.950
-What's happening? 
- Look! The control tower!

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:23.510
We are the members of the Revolutionary Chamber
 under the command of Lieutenant Sabaji!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.130
The airport is now shut down!

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.120
All civilians must leave immediately!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:32.500
- Revolutionary Chamber?! 
- A coup d'état?!

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:58.710
How outrageous! 
 Are they going to engage in guerrilla warfare at the airport?!

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:05.430
- Please! To the car!
- Where's Kajika? - She went to get her bags.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:09.700
- Kajika! 
- Young master, to the car!

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:12.510
- Let me go! I have to get Kajika!
- No!

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:16.010
What's going to happen to the Rosenthals if something happens to you!

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:19.930
- Let me go, Harris! 
- Hurry up, take him!

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:22.640
Kajika! Kajika!

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:37.540
Where are you, Kajika! 
 Kajika!

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:43.310
- Lee-Leng! Lee-Leng, I'm here! 
- Kajika!

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:47.830
Are you OK?

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:53.720
- I'm glad! 
- Lee-Leng.

00:09:58.470 --> 00:10:02.740
Are they trying to involve civilians?
 We're going to run, alright?!

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:08.250
Slave of the King! 
Eat this!

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.040
Duck!

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:31.950
Lee-Leng, are you OK?

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:38.350
Lee-Leng!

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.930
What is this?! 
 No!

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:46.890
Lee-Leng! 
Don't die!

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:51.890
Lee-Leng! Lee-Leng! 
 An ambulance...

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:59.030
No, I can't. 
It's turned into a war zone here.

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:05.080
What can I do?! 
 When is this firefight going to stop?

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:09.950
What if it's prolonged and help doesn't come?

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:18.840
No! Lee-Leng!
 Lee-Leng! Wake up!

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:21.670
Open your eyes, Lee-Leng!

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:25.690
No! No!

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:28.840
Don't leave me here!

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:33.560
- Kajika! Are you alright?! 
- Isaac!

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:40.400
- He's alright. His pulse is strong. 
- Really?!

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:46.010
I was told through His Majesty Rumaty from Singapore.

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:49.930
He told me to take care of you.
 I'm glad I found you.

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:54.900
We can escape through the back now.
 You can follow me, right?

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:03.630
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:15.250
Hurry up and get the army to crush the opposition at once!

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:18.920
But they have already taken over the airport, the coast...

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:22.010
...and the TV station.

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:25.450
Take back the TV station first.

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:31.180
We must label them the "rebels" and put an end to them.

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:36.630
To make the people understand that justice and power lies in the Palace...

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:39.650
...the most simple way is to use the TV station.

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:42.870
Yes, sir!
 We're on it!

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.360
Please be calm, Master Sareha.

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:50.640
We'll be able to clean this mess up by tomorrow.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:54.660
Our military power is significantly more than theirs.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.970
All we need to do is to stand with authority.

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:00.770
Right, you're right.

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:06.920
Did it start, Quinza?

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:10.710
Should I go back to the Chadlis'?

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:15.040
There's no need for that. 
 The Palace is safe.

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:17.460
This is just a small splash.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:22.340
- Once it's settled, we'll announce the next queen.
- And...

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:26.100
...when is the big tsunami going to come?

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:30.810
Now, that's something for the gods to decide.

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:36.000
What's more important right now is to prepare for the wedding ceremony.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:40.460
- The country will be at ease. 
- Queen?

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:43.200
Are you talking about this king's?

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:52.850
You understand what is going on in your country.

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.900
I've heard you were always an introvert.

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:00.180
Couldn't resist the pressure of the throne?

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:04.540
Or did you plan for it to be this way?

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:08.020
We're taking care of it under wraps.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:13.240
But the current situation of the King must be concealed.

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:17.350
That's why we have to hurry with the wedding ceremony.

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:22.670
I'm going to go take care of the coup d'état.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:32.350
Eugene, Somand is enjoying his life.

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:35.570
Finally, he can go to sleep without being worried.

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:39.300
What part of being confined is joyful?

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:42.010
You should be careful too.

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:46.210
He is not a man that you can handle.

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:51.120
How many times do I have to tell you?
 I am Najayra from the Chadli household.

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:56.210
The reason you're alive is because I commanded Quinza to do so.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.970
Quinza will listen to everything that I say.

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:03.570
If Quinza isn't really the man I'm looking for...

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.070
...I won't have any mercy.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:13.450
<i>Those are her true thoughts.</i>

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:16.730
<i>It'll be easy for you to do that.</i>

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:22.400
<i>But the problem is that Quinza is not that simple of a man.</i>

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:29.280
<i>If he thinks it's necessary, he wouldn't even move his brow to get rid of you.</i>

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:31.820
<i>The same fate looms over me too.</i>

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:37.880
<i>I don't know if I can leave this palace alive.</i>

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:43.580
<i>It's a surprise that I'm still kept alive.</i>

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:49.030
<i>But the information I've gathered will go to waste.</i>

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:56.420
I have to think of a way to get this information to Kajika.

00:15:58.710 --> 00:16:02.850
The coup d'état that occurred last night is now calming down.

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:06.260
The army suppressed the rebel group...

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:09.830
...and the perpetrators have been detained.

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:17.540
I called the American Embassy, though there are no signs of Master Kajika or Master Lee-Leng.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:20.980
I shouldn't have let him go alone.

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:25.370
Master Lee-Leng told me to contact Director Harry if anything happened.

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:28.020
I'm going to go to New York!

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:40.060
There's nothing to worry about. The injury isn't critical.

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:42.920
He had a slight concussion.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:48.690
-Oh, that's good to hear!
- He has to rest here for a little bit. - OK

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:52.860
It's a miracle that you don't even have a scratch on you.

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:56.940
Lee-Leng protected me.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.350
Lieutenant, look at the TV!

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:03.210
- Lieutenant Sabaji has been arrested!
- What?!

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:08.150
Lieutenant Sabaji and 12 other men were detained...

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:11.240
...by the orders of His Majesty, they have been...

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:13.540
...sentenced to death.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:19.430
- Death penalty?!
- They're using this to show their power.

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:23.920
I knew this was going to happen. 
 I thought it would last longer.

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:29.140
If Rumaty hears about this, he'll be saddened.

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:31.280
Who is she, Lieutenant?

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:35.550
Let me introduce you to her.
 She is Kajika Burnsworth.

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:39.880
She's the daughter of the Burnsworth household, who has been protecting His Majesty Rumaty.

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:44.620
- Nice to meet you.
- You're from the Burnsworths?!

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:48.800
- Can you tell me about His Majesty Rumaty?!
- How is he?!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:54.530
I came to Raginei for Rumaty.

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:59.820
Rumaty wanted to more than anyone.

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:04.250
He would have done so in the past, even if danger followed.

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:09.220
But he didn't come since he knew what he meant to others.

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:15.360
He knew if he acted on his own will, everyone's effort would go to waste.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:22.020
I want to tell you that Rumaty has matured to be able to think like that.

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.410
That's why I'm here: to present to you his true feelings.

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:31.070
Beyond anyone, he thinks and cares for the country and its people.

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:34.860
Don't forget that Rumaty's heart is here.

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.030
<i>Kajika.</i>

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:44.700
- Your Majesty!
- One day we'll lead you to your home country!

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:49.030
She'll be here until martial law is dissolved.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:55.560
- Keep in mind...
- If it's His Majesty's friend, I will put my life on the line!

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.410
Leave it up to us!

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:05.410
I'm going to go back to Lee-Leng's.

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:11.050
What a mysterious girl.
 I was even moved by her.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.450
It was as though His Majesty was here.

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:19.810
- They are similar. 
- What do you think about asking for her help?

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:22.510
To be the icon of the opposition group.

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:26.300
It's a great idea, but he won't let us.

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:40.570
Lee-Leng are you awake?
 Do you know who I am?

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:45.160
Kajika, are you alright?

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:48.000
Lee-Leng, you protected me.

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:51.820
They said your wounds will heal quickly!

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:56.250
As long as you're OK.

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:03.000
Lee-Leng, I really wanted to come to Raginei.

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:05.580
I knew that danger would follow.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:10.230
But I can't believe I even got you involved in it.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:13.070
Don't worry about me.

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:16.090
It's not your fault.

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:23.390
<i>I knew that you wouldn't give up on coming here.</i>

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:34.220
<i>But I still wanted to stop you.</i>

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:39.540
<i>Even if you would hate me for doing so.</i>

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:44.570
<i>But when you started to change how you looked at me...</i>

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:48.200
<i>...I didn't think anything could be worse.</i>

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:51.100
Lee-Leng.

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:54.760
Are you really going to get married?

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:03.940
My uncles are set on that idea.
 Why?

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:11.930
- If you like Ling-Lee, I'll bear it.
- Kajika.

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:18.460
Can I tell you the truth since we're alone?

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:25.630
I don't want you to be in love with anyone else!

00:21:26.230 --> 00:21:30.250
I thought we would be together forever.

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:32.640
I didn't doubt that.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.810
I feel so stupid...

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:39.360
...I thought like a child.

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:44.330
Don't be foolish...

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:50.730
...do you think I'll take anyone over you?

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:53.720
You are the most precious thing to me.

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:57.830
Forever, whatever happens.

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:00.640
Lee-Leng, you're so mature.

00:22:02.390 --> 00:22:05.320
You'll always listen to my childish rants.

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:11.690
I should have told you my feelings sooner.

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:17.650
The last two years, we weren't able to be alone.

00:22:19.080 --> 00:22:21.980
Just like this, like the old days.

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:27.840
I love you, Lee-Leng.

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:30.170
Kajika.

00:22:32.650 --> 00:22:36.060
The one that's childish is me.

00:22:37.590 --> 00:22:39.370
I don't want to let go of your hand.

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:47.400
I feel like I can leave it all...

00:22:48.670 --> 00:22:50.620
...my status, the glory, and my family.

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:56.760
Everything for your embrace.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.500 --> 00:24:14.490
Next Week

00:23:44.500 --> 00:24:14.490
"Within the Circle of Destiny"

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So no one else knows our secret thoughts.

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:23.730
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
